# (P2c wave 2, ACTIONS-2H) the spear's other blows: hit 2 the higher thrust (the haft raised a step), hit 3 the lunge
# (a deeper coil, both arms at full reach, the step 5 px); the glaive's and the halberd's hit 3 the sweep (the haft
# over the back shoulder, down and forward at full reach, through), first so it wins for their forms; DEPTH: the guard
# set against a charge (crouched, the butt grounded, the head at a rider's chest) when the sim flags `spear-set`
# (FOLK-SIM-C's ask). Timing at pace 1.1 (finisher follow 308 ms). Written by ACTIONS-2H's tools/fams.py.
